Build qiskit-aer 0.17.2 for WebAssembly (Pyodide 314, wasm32-unknown-emscripten).

- CMake: no AVX2 flags from the host CPU; no conan; header-only nlohmann_json and
  spdlog plus Pyodide's libopenblas are provided in wasm-deps/ by build.sh.
- wasm-deps/include/omp.h: single-threaded OpenMP runtime stub (no OpenMP in
  Emscripten; some headers call omp_* without #ifdef _OPENMP).
- BLAS/LAPACK prototypes return int on emscripten to match Pyodide's f2c-style
  OpenBLAS (WebAssembly rejects mismatched call signatures at link time).
- get_system_memory_mb() returned 0 under Emscripten, which made every shot
  produce no data; report the 4 GiB wasm32 limit instead.
- Jobs run on a synchronous executor (threads cannot be started under Pyodide).
- psutil is optional (no wasm build); conan dropped from build requirements.

